# Harness output. The test scripts in _framework/ render decks and write PNGs,
# and they run with BUILD_ASDAN as their working directory — so a screenshot
# lands here, next to the strands, where a directory-glob `git add` will take
# it. One did, in 6f61323. This is the control that does not depend on anyone
# remembering the manifest rule.
#
# No tracked image lives under BUILD_ASDAN, so the pattern costs nothing.
*.png
*.jpg
*.webp

# Anything a harness is told to write goes here.
_out/
